              "#### Conclusion\nOver the last five months, there have been tariff proposals by the U.S. and its trading partners.  In the same period, Central Illinois corn and soybean prices have both dropped substantially.  How much of the price decline is due to trade negotiations is an open question, but it did play a large role in those price declines. With these price declines, incomes prospects for 2018 have dimmed"
            ]
